OL,3,AHurricane Isaias strengthens to
OL,4,Acategory three as evacuations orders
OL,5,Aissued along US Gulf Coast
OL,6,
OL,7,FStates of emergency have also been
OL,8,Fissued in parts of Alabama, Florida and
OL,9,Fin all of Georgia as they brace for
OL,10,Fheavy rain
OL,12,FThe latest data from aircraft tracking
OL,13,Fthe hurricane shows it now has
OL,14,Fsustained wind speeds of 120mph
OL,15,F(193km/h), with even higher gusts
OL,17,FFind out which airports, roads and
OL,18,Frailways are scheduled to close
OL,20,FMore than half of oil production in the
OL,21,FGulf has also paused as workers are
OL,22,Fevacuated
